  "description": "Erection of 1st and 2nd floor mezzanine floors, proposed new main entrance, creation of new openings in wall to create external access storage unit to east elevation, refurbishment of existing shutters and internal alterations to existing warehouse (Please note for information puposes only the address for this application was previously known as Unit 1A, now known as Unit 2)",
