  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major general industry-storage-warehousing",
  "lapsed_date": "17/12/2010",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - The premises hereby approved, shall only be used for self-storage with ancillary offices, with the premises to revert to its original floor area (without mezzanine extensions) on the cessation of that use and prior to a change of use to another warehousing (use class B8) or light industrial/industrial (use classes B1c and B2) use with ancillary offices, unless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 5 - The use hereby permitted shall not be open to customers outside the following times:8:00am to 6:00pm Monday to Wednesday, and Friday and Saturday 8:00am to 8:00pm Thursdays10:0am to 4:00pm on Sundays and Bank Holidays."
